# Base URL of the generation service (no trailing path). It serves /health, /rewrite, /route, /generate.
#
#   - Empty (the default for `npm run dev` and `npm test`): degraded mode. The page never touches
#     the network; deterministic glossary expansion + BM25 + original articles only.
#   - web/.env.production (committed, it is a public URL) points `npm run build` at the Cloudflare
#     Tunnel: https://law-api.waniagent.top
#   - To try the full mode locally, put the URL in web/.env.local (git-ignored), e.g.
#       VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8790
#     The service must answer CORS preflight for the dev origin (http://localhost:5173).
VITE_API_URL=
